##  Optimization Options

| Strategy                           | Impact                          |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Increase `maxThreads`              | Handle more concurrent requests |
| Tune `acceptCount`                 | Avoid dropping early            |
| Use async (WebFlux)                | Non-blocking, scales better     |
| Pool heavy objects (e.g., buffers) | Avoid per-request creation      |
| Enable connection pool tuning      | Reduce DB object churn          |

